<!--
  Fixture: multi_program_output
  Synthetic, hand-written. Imitates SoftwareRevision 32.02.
  Scenario (ADR-0002): the physical output Local:4:O.Data.3 (alias Conveyor_Run_Out)
  is turned on in program Outputs, but its conditions come from three places:
    - Line_Permissive, written in program Safety_Perms from an input alias and a
      consumed tag produced by another controller;
    - RunReq, a program input parameter connected to \Sequencer.RunCmd;
    - RunCmd, written by the ST step sequence in program Sequencer.
  Also exercises: I/O modules with ports and connections, a source-protected AOI,
  an AOI with an InOut parameter, SFC and FBD routines, a multi-language
  description, a pending online-edit rung, an event task, and one unknown element.
-->
